3
00:00:06,058 --> 00:00:08,058
Story number 1.

4
00:00:08,058 --> 00:00:13,220
Why is Elon Musk plotting a mega-merger of SpaceX and Tesla.

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:20,132
Musk says there's "a lot to be gained" by combining the firms in what would be the biggest merger in history.

6
00:00:20,132 --> 00:00:22,147
Story number 2.

7
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:27,758
Part of Antarctica named after former BBC science correspondent.

8
00:00:27,758 --> 00:00:35,338
A stretch of water in the west of the continent is now called the Amos Channel after the ex-BBC journalist.

9
00:00:35,338 --> 00:00:37,441
Story number 3.

10
00:00:37,441 --> 00:00:41,647
Mission blasts off for Mars to grab a piece of its moon.

11
00:00:41,647 --> 00:00:48,970
A spacecraft is set to launch on an ambitious mission to bring 10g of Martian moon dust back to Earth.

12
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:52,911
That concludes today’s English listening briefing.

13
00:00:52,911 --> 00:00:54,882
